Through Artful Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather clues, record observations, and piece together the truth using Hope\u2019s sketchbook. Dive deep into the investigation to uncover what lies beneath the city\u2019s calm facade.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ce15442b26b0a00eefe636695186787b.poster.avif?t=1772056784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ce15442b26b0a00eefe636695186787b.webm?t=1772056784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ce15442b26b0a00eefe636695186787b.mp4?t=1772056784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Unique Gameplay Mechanic, Based on Thoughts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress as you build your observations into theories and make breakthroughs that will get you closer to solving the mysterious disappearance of your parents.<br> <br><br><strong>Creative and Unique Triangulated Art Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a bold triangulated art style that blends story and visuals, creating a unique world that invites closer exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ba478746b30e9fe2914d8ff1a0cd4a85.poster.avif?t=1772056784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ba478746b30e9fe2914d8ff1a0cd4a85.webm?t=1772056784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ba478746b30e9fe2914d8ff1a0cd4a85.mp4?t=1772056784\" type=\"video/mp4\"><